  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new audio system, voices from giant avatars can be very quiet or almost inaudible because their head is far above you. Before the update they could be heard loud and clear, but after the update it's almost impossible to hear someone talking with a giant avatar. Perhaps slightly increasing their voice range and volume would be more realistic as their voice should carry further.",
